<title>USA: Talbots March same-store sales rose 1 pct.</title>
<headline>Talbots March same-store sales rose 1 pct.</headline>
<dateline>HINGMAN, Mass. 1997-04-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Talbots Inc Thursday reported sales for the five and nine week periods ended April 5.</p>
<p>	     Sales in millions of dollars     Percent change</p>
<p>		    1997	 1996	     Total     Same-Store</p>
<p>Month	     $111.6     $102.6	+9.0	 +1.0</p>
<p>Year-to-date    $166.4     $154.7	+8.0	 +0.7</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610.))</p>
</text>
